OL,3,GNEWSA'Crucial' neurodiversity scheme
OL,4,Acould be expanded
OL,5,
OL,6,FA programme supporting children and
OL,7,Fyoung people who are, or may be,
OL,8,Fneurodivergent could be expanded after
OL,9,Freceiving nearly 2,000 inquiries in its
OL,10,Ffirst year.
OL,12,FCumberland Council's Neurodiversity and
OL,13,FEmotional Wellbeing Service offers
OL,14,Fadvice, guidance and signposting, as
OL,15,Fwell as an assessment to help identify
OL,16,Fsupport which could be needed.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
