OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1795245988
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Crucial' neurodiversity scheme
OL,4,Acould be expanded
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlotte Malik, from Maryport, said
OL,7,Fthe service was "crucial", and having
OL,8,F"backing" through the assessment -
OL,9,Fwhich is not a formal diagnosis -
OL,10,Fhelped get her nine-year-old son
OL,11,Fsupport in school.
OL,13,FExecutive member for public health
OL,14,FJustin McDermott said he hoped the
OL,15,Fapproach would be integrated across
OL,16,Fother services and potentially adapted
OL,17,Ffor adults.
